  "post_title": "Carnicería Rubén, en la calle del Carmen de Onda, ya está preparada para Fira",
  "post_date": "2015-10-17 17:44:40",
  "post_name": "carniceria-ruben-en-la-calle-del-carmen-de-onda-ya-esta-preparada-para-fira",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>(14 fotos) Carnicer&iacute;a Rub&eacute;n, en la calle del Carmen, junto al jard&iacute;n de Cervantes de Onda, en pleno recorrido de los encierros, ya est&aacute; preparada para abastecer en Fira a todas las pe&ntilde;as, con jamones de gran calidad s&oacute;lo a 40&euro;, embutidos secos ideales para el almuerzo o merienda, o longanizas secas&nbsp;grandes.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/IMG_9710.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 720px;\" /></p>\n<p>Los jamones incluyen, adem&aacute;s, el regalo de un cuchillo grande jamonero y un afilador. La Carnicer&iacute;a Rub&eacute;n ha ampliado tambi&eacute;n su gama de productos con chocolates Leyre, de diferentes variedades, todas de gran calidad.</p>\n<p>Adem&aacute;s, este lunes de Fira d&#39;Onda, d&iacute;a de las paellas, Carnicer&iacute;a Rub&eacute;n permanecer&aacute; abierta de 9 a 13.30 horas para poder compar todo lo necesario para cocinarlas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9580.jpg\" alt=\"img_9580\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9581.jpg\" alt=\"img_9581\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9582.jpg\" alt=\"img_9582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9587.jpg\" alt=\"img_9587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9588.jpg\" alt=\"img_9588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9709.jpg\" alt=\"img_9709\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9710.jpg\" alt=\"img_9710\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9818.jpg\" alt=\"img_9818\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9820.jpg\" alt=\"img_9820\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9821.jpg\" alt=\"img_9821\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9823.jpg\" alt=\"img_9823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9826.jpg\" alt=\"img_9826\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9827.jpg\" alt=\"img_9827\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenfira15/img_9830.jpg\" alt=\"img_9830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
